# Mekanism Radiation Expansion (Concept Fork)

⚠️ **Note:** This is **not a working mod**.  
This fork exists only as a **testbed for ideas, design docs, and community feedback** about a possible radiation expansion for [Mekanism](https://github.com/mekanism/Mekanism).

---

## 🌍 Project Vision
The **Radiation Expansion** aims to add more depth to Mekanism’s radiation system with new devices, tools, and mechanics.  
The idea is to create a **community-driven, open project** where anyone can contribute, suggest features, or improve the concept.

---

## 🔧 Planned Features
- **Radiation Detection Devices (RDD)**  
  Stationary block with tiered upgrades. Outputs different redstone signals depending on detected radiation level.  
  - Toggleable beeping alarm  
  - Button to ignore natural background radiation  
  - Uses Mekanism-style redstone logic  

- **Portable Detection Device (PDD)**  
  Handheld tool similar to a Geiger Counter/Dosimeter.  
  - Custom HUD for live readings  
  - Beeping can be toggled (HUD always stays on)  
  - Fixed storage: half of a tiered tank  

- **Area Purification Device (APD)**  
  Tiered block for cleansing radiation.  
  - Storage = half of corresponding Mekanism tank capacity  
  - Higher tiers = larger purification radius and efficiency  

